sequenceDiagram
    participant Auditor1 as Auditor 1
    participant Auditor2 as Auditor 2
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant CR as Collaboration & Review
    participant WAL as Workpaper Authoring & Lifecycle
    participant DB as DynamoDB
    participant EB as EventBridge
    participant GAL as Governance, Audit Trail & Lineage

    Auditor1->>UI: Edit Section/Field (Parallel Editing)
    UI->>WAL: Save Changes (workpaperId, updates)
    WAL->>DB: Create New Immutable Version
    DB-->>WAL: Confirm Version
    WAL->>EB: Emit Event (VersionUpdated)
    EB->>GAL: Log Edit Event (Who, What, When)
    EB->>CR: Trigger Presence Update
    CR-->>UI: Update Presence Indicators (Auditor2 sees Auditor1 editing)
    Auditor1->>UI: Add Threaded Comment (Anchored to Field)
    UI->>CR: Post Comment (workpaperId, section, text)
    CR->>DB: Store Comment Metadata
    DB-->>CR: Confirm
    CR->>EB: Emit Event (CommentAdded)
    EB->>GAL: Log Comment Event
    EB->>UI: Notify Auditor2 (In-App/Email for Mention)
    Auditor2->>UI: Review & Respond to Comment
    UI->>CR: Update Comment (Resolve/Reject)
    CR->>EB: Emit Event (CommentResolved)
    EB->>GAL: Log Resolution